@startuml
actor User as user
participant "JwtAuthenticationTokenFilter" as filter
participant "UserDetailsService" as uds
participant "SecurityContextHolder" as context
participant "AccessDecisionManager" as adm
participant "Protected API" as api

user -> filter: 请求头携带 Token
filter -> filter: 从 Header 提取 Token
filter -> filter: 检查 Token 是否在黑名单或过期
filter -> uds: 调用 loadUserByUsername()
uds -> uds: 查询用户及角色
uds --> filter: 返回 UserDetails（含角色）
filter -> context: setAuthentication()
context --> filter: 安全上下文已更新
filter -> api: 执行后续过滤器链
api -> adm: 检查接口权限
adm -> adm: 验证用户角色是否匹配
adm --> api: 权限通过
api --> user: 返回数据
@enduml